    "title": "Remote file copy over SSH transport",
    "desc": "A file was copied to or from a remote host with scp, rsync or sftp (a remote `user@host:path` or `host:path` spec). This is ingress or egress tool transfer (MITRE T1105) - pulling a tool in or pushing collected data out over an SSH channel. download_ip_to_tmp covers an HTTP fetch of an IP literal; this covers the SSH-transport copies. On a host where these accounts do not deploy, a remote copy is the transfer step of an intrusion.",
